{/* Dark only (brand decision 2026-10-06, site/OUTLINE.md). Starlight's
  default ThemeProvider reads the stored `starlight-theme` choice and the OS
  `prefers-color-scheme` and writes `data-theme` accordingly; this override
  forces `dark` instead, and drops any stale stored choice so a returning
  visitor who once picked light never flashes or sticks on it. Inlined, as
  the default was, so it runs in `<head>` before first paint. */}
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  try {
    localStorage.removeItem('starlight-theme');
  } catch {
    // Storage unavailable (blocked cookies, private mode): the forced
    // `data-theme` above already holds, so there is nothing to clean up.
  }
</script>
